{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dafd430d9bc3cd56c0f8e9ba4c5aa5f7c70936c0c7e37845b6fbf56266e95667", "ja": "（短期特番に続き、BOTの公演も終わった。\nまだ勝負は続くが、とりあえず一段落だな）", "zh": "（继短期特别节目之后，BOT的公演也结束了。虽然胜负还在继续，不过暂时算是告一段落了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "684a9bf2a530ebf4464f2cc42b88baf525365f23717446b434081c80cacdd99c", "ja": "ヘイヘイヘーイ、{$P$}ちゃん！\nどうしたんだい？　アンニュイな表情を浮かべて……。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿——，{$P$}！\n怎么啦？一脸慵懒的表情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "0685f1f2bbbb493296f9e0554a48d83ed9ab1c99aa0ab30cd59dbeb20242bd0a", "ja": "さては、茜ちゃんロスだね？\n茜ちゃんとの仕事の後は、いつもそんな顔してるゾ☆", "zh": "看来是有点小茜戒断吧？\n每次和小茜一起工作后，你总是这副表情哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "75d4f42b170bb627e4b0b6f16949086b732029ab712d279dcbd89b1b7c809351", "ja": "茜ロス……そうだったのか。\nところで、茜は何か用事か？", "zh": "茜缺失症……原来是这么回事。\n话说回来，茜是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "d74560861737f3879f961f234a8a57876d0e01e76250be12fd088ea8fa7cbf71", "ja": "もちろん！　お疲れな{$P$}ちゃんの\n前に現れた、天使のような茜ちゃん……。", "zh": "当然啦！宛如天使般降临在\n疲惫的{$P$}面前的小茜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "378fd343b79e4417c0fd9b4f113ce197c79450ac8515f9fd42e4f6de6ab0e3c9", "ja": "なんと今日は、プレゼントを用意しているッ！\nさあ、感涙に咽びながら受け取るがいいっ！", "zh": "没错，今天茜茜还准备了礼物哦！\n来吧，一边感动得热泪盈眶，一边收下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c9994a7eb7c79fddeefd391317c746ce3a9aed1dc21e45c2d36a2b4cf434546d", "ja": "いや、いきなりそう言われても……。\nというか、何のプレゼントなんだ？", "zh": "不，突然这么说，我也……  \n话说回来，到底是什么礼物？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "7549ca3d275999374dd29c0d3032fe1ad324d61b0f9046500c9cfd273e9f6c80", "ja": "な、ナンデナンデ！？　お仕事お疲れさま～っていう、\n茜ちゃんのささやかな気持ちだよ！　わかるでしょ？", "zh": "为、为什么为什么！？这是小茜对你辛苦工作的一点小小心意啦！你应该懂的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "ee8b83442d57915d08e21d7f99016f2a26c439ec802ab32f30e10331e403c99a", "ja": "特番やBOTで、裏方頑張ってたもんネ！\nその労いだから！　ほら、受け取るのだーっ！", "zh": "你在特别节目和BOT里一直努力做幕后工作嘛！\n这是给你的慰劳！来，收下吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2012", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2003_p", "source_sha256": "09517390fe50950428fc413913573481c4b99e2040359782dcbe42487a5e11fd", "ja": "うーん、まあそういうことならもらうよ、ありがとう。\nええと……あれ？　これは、茜の人形か……？", "zh": "嗯……既然你都这么说了，那我就收下了，谢谢。\n呃……咦？这是茜的人偶吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2004_se", "source_sha256": "5270263766c15d124b125f9328b114431680f939a5e6cbc8949ddc564e475d04", "ja": "ブッシャアアァァァーッ！！", "zh": "哗啦啦啦啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2005_p", "source_sha256": "690d0880bdc70f041bf6fdfa66660e39308f3a6f3e61314eee1faf6c86b88371", "ja": "う、うわあーっ！？　なんだ、水が！？", "zh": "呜、呜哇——！？怎么回事，水、水喷出来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2006_023aka", "source_sha256": "f529275716ba014f0cb2da4bd5739d644f83113adb3cf357bf18adacfc5e8f4c", "ja": "ニャーッハッハッハーッ！　かかったな！\nそれは試作品の、放水型茜ちゃん人形だよ！", "zh": "喵哈哈哈哈——！中招了吧！\n那是试作品的喷水型小茜人偶哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2007_023aka", "source_sha256": "1a2a2f3db3f7f81afa731620420c51b6389686e7c25489125b21ea8875f920b8", "ja": "ドッキリ大成功！　{$P$}ちゃんも、\n茜ちゃんにドッキリを仕掛けた側だからね！", "zh": "恶作剧大成功！{$P$}也属于对小茜搞恶作剧的一方嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2008_023aka", "source_sha256": "a3843e4052c6272dbbb081f4a7e5bd7ca0437a25f62789e24fd7bce6b7719613", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、受けた恩は忘れない……そして、\n恨みも忘れないのだー！　ニャハッ☆", "zh": "小茜不会忘记别人给予的恩情……当然，也不会忘记仇恨——！喵哈哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2009_p", "source_sha256": "df6cf901626a58a588fde69d5974d9356481a7034a19d58226c8ae8cdfe97115", "ja": "……茜……。", "zh": "……茜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2010_023aka", "source_sha256": "8101a458cfb7613c87dbccbfdca3b2d35441a13fc5d273fb6fee821920cb4fe0", "ja": "ぎ……ギニャッ！？　こ、これは……\nもしかして、割とガチめなお怒り……？", "zh": "咕……咕喵！？这、这是……  \n难不成是相当认真地生气了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0563_2011_023aka", "source_sha256": "27d35a3b3219634ef18c965199bdfe8ab4084ed923041553c5ccb3009fa7cff0", "ja": "ヒェーッ！？　て、撤退ーっ！　作戦行動は完遂した、\n速やかに離脱するのだーっ！　ニャハハーッ☆", "zh": "呀——！？撤、撤退——！作战行动已经完成，立即撤离——！喵哈哈——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
